A '''Chuckwalla''' is a {{Rare}} [[Critter]] that can be found in the {{Gold|Cavern}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Spawning ==
{{Green|2-4}} '''Chuckwallas''' spawn in the {{Gold|Cavern}} biome of the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Chuckwallas''' sit next to a hole in a wall. Upon being startled, it runs inside to hide, requiring the player to enter to chase after it. If a {{Item|Critter Capsule}} is thrown at a '''Chuckwalla''' and is caught, it drops a {{Item|Chuckwalla Shard}}.

